=== 1. Replica set members ===
  mongo-lagos:27017         (not reachable/healthy)health=0
  mongo-portharcourt:27017  PRIMARY    health=1
  mongo-abuja:27017         SECONDARY  health=1

=== 2. Write with writeConcern majority (acknowledged by 2 of 3 nodes) ===
  acknowledged after 8 ms

=== 3. Read the same document with different guarantees ===
{
  primary_majority: 1,
  secondary_local: 1,
  nearest_available: 1
}
  1 = found. A secondary read may return 0 if replication has not caught up yet (eventual consistency).

=== 4. Replication lag per secondary ===
  mongo-abuja:27017 is 4 s behind the primary

=== 5. w: 3 needs every node; it times out if one is down ===
  w:3 write NOT fully acknowledged: WriteConcernFailed (waiting for replication timed out)
